13	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.360562	149.165237	30.00	1

# WP14: Platform 2 (Y=200m, expect LiDAR ~2000cm)
14	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.361462	149.165237	30.00	1

# WP15: Platform 1 (Y=100m, expect LiDAR ~2500cm)
15	0	3	16	0	0	0	0	-35.362362	149.165237	30.00	1

# WP16: Approach (Y=50m, descend to 15m AGL)
